# 27. PERFORMANCE AND ACCESSIBILITY

Optimize the application for real business usage.

Requirements:

* Lazy-load routes where appropriate.
* Paginate large lists.
* Optimize image previews.
* Avoid unnecessary component re-renders.
* Use indexes for common queries.
* Keep mobile interactions fast.
* Support keyboard navigation.
* Use semantic HTML.
* Provide accessible labels.
* Maintain sufficient text contrast.
* Do not use color as the only status indicator.
* Provide readable error and validation messages.

The Salesperson interface must remain usable on smaller Android phones.

