# FINAL PRODUCT REQUIREMENT

Deliver a fully functional, secure, responsive PerlEvents Banquet & Event Management ERP.

The Admin must have complete authorized control over banquets, availability, leads, clients, events, vendors, sales, invoices, payments, managers, and reports.

The Salesperson experience must be genuinely mobile-first, with a persistent and properly implemented bottom navigation bar.

The Manager must have a focused event execution dashboard with real-time checklist updates.

All modules must share consistent data and permissions.

Booking availability must be concurrency-safe, financial calculations must be accurate, and all critical operations must be validated and auditable.

Prioritize operational reliability, mobile usability, clean architecture, and production readiness over decorative UI.

The final application must be deployable and maintainable, not merely visually convincing.
